    "enable": "The probes talk Modbus RTU over RS-485 as standalone devices; no separate enable step is described. Vaisala Insight PC software exposes the same configuration settings.",
    "watchdog": null,
    "quirks": [
      "Floats are low word first (CDAB); pick \"word-swapped\" float in masters that default to high word first.",
      "Read or write each 32-bit value in one transaction."
    ],
    "setup": [
      "Defaults: address 240, 19200 baud, no parity, 8 data bits, 2 stop bits.",
      "Up to ten probes can share one RS-485 line, each with its own address (register 1537).",
      "Change serial settings with registers 1538-1540; register 1542 restarts the probe."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "Use the test registers (7937 on) to confirm float format and addressing before trusting readings.",
      "When condensation prevention warming is on, RH-dependent outputs are unavailable unless you write the real air temperature to register 821."
    ]
  },
